{
  "enabled": true,
  "name": "Systems Architecture Specialist Review",
  "description": "Especialista em engenharia e arquitetura de sistemas que revisa código aplicando SOLID, Clean Code, padrões de projeto, performance e segurança.",
  "version": "1",
  "when": {
    "type": "fileEdited",
    "patterns": [
      "*.php",
      "*.js",
      "*.ts"
    ]
  },
  "then": {
    "type": "askAgent",
    "prompt": "You are a senior systems engineer and software architect expert in SOLID, Clean Code, design patterns, performance, and security. Review the edited file applying your expertise in software architecture and engineering best practices. Check for: 1) SOLID principles compliance across the architecture, 2) Proper design patterns usage (Repository, Service Layer, Strategy, Observer, Factory, etc.), 3) Clean Code principles (readability, maintainability, testability), 4) Security vulnerabilities (SQL injection, XSS, CSRF, mass assignment, insecure deserialization), 5) Performance bottlenecks (unnecessary loops, memory leaks, blocking operations), 6) Proper error handling and exception management, 7) Dependency flow correctness (Controller → Service → Repository → Model), 8) Separation of concerns, 9) LGPD compliance considerations (data privacy, consent, deletion capability), 10) ACL and authorization checks, 11) Input validation and sanitization, 12) Proper use of environment variables for secrets, 13) Caching strategy, 14) Code scalability and extensibility, 15) Potential race conditions or concurrency issues. If you find issues, suggest specific fixes with architectural recommendations. Keep suggestions concise and actionable."
  }
}